<title>USA: NCS HealthCare Inc Q2 Dec. 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>NCS HealthCare Inc Q2 Dec. 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.17   profit	 $0.10</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,889   profit	   725</p>
<p> Revs			59,323		   27,599</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,016		    6,949</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.32     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,799     loss	   324</p>
<p> Revs		     102,365		   50,027</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,805		    6,941</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Six-month results for 1995 hurt by one-time $2.8 million charge from expenses from acquisitions. Excluding the charge, net income for the period would have been $1.3 million, or $0.19 per share.</p>
<p>In October 1996 the company completed a public offering of 4.24 million shares of common stock, raising $131.3 million.</p>
